Trans:
**❗️How to Get 6600 UAH from the UN in 2023?

Applications are accepted exclusively offline at registration points (addresses can be found [HERE](https://kosht.media/dopomoha-dlia-vpo-iak-otrymaty-6600-hrn-vid-oon-u-2023-rotsi/)). Bring your family in full composition as assistance can be provided for all family members simultaneously.

Take with you originals of the following documents for each person:

- tax number;
- passport or other identity documents;
- refugee status certificate (if applicable);
- bank card of the main applicant;
- birth certificate of children (if applicable);
- document confirming legal guardianship of a child (if applicable);
- disability certificate or medical certificate in case of disability or chronic illness (if applicable).

If a person meets the criteria, an SMS message will be sent to their mobile phone at least one month after the application is submitted.

Read the list of those who may receive assistance [HERE](https://r2p.org.ua/rozshyreno-kryteriyi-lyudej-shho-mozhut-otrymaty-dopomogu-vid-uv

