Trans:
⚡️**Ukraine's First Official Response to the Situation in Kherson**

**Mikhail Podolyak, advisor to the head of the Presidential Office, in an [interview with Reuters](https://www.reuters.com/world/europe/ukraine-presidential-adviser-too-soon-talk-russian-withdrawal-kherson-2022-11-09):**
- Ukraine is not paying attention to Russian statements; words and actions do not match;
- **Some Russian troops remain in Kherson,** and additional Russian labor force is being deployed to the region;
- Our armed forces are working according to their plan: reconnaissance, risk assessment, effective counterattack;
- Until the Ukrainian flag is flying over Kherson, there is no point in talking about Russia's withdrawal.

